391
17:53.270 --> 17:55.070
I didn't say I wouldn't treat it.

392
17:55.590 --> 17:56.920
I need to do it step by step, right?

393
17:56.920 --> 17:57.480
What's the rush?

394
17:57.480 --> 17:59.400
You're still not in a hurry? Huh?

395
18:01.510 --> 18:02.200
My dreams are all about

396
18:02.200 --> 18:03.350
