397
18:03.350 --> 18:04.960
Can you please do something?

398
18:05.680 --> 18:07.610
I'm not saying I won't do anything.

399
18:07.640 --> 18:09.400
I just can't act blindly.

400
18:10.070 --> 18:10.880
Well,

401
18:11.200 --> 18:13.330
you're not working right now, are you?

402
18:13.550 --> 18:14.550
Let's treat it.

403
18:15.160 --> 18:16.030
If you start working,

404
18:16.030 --> 18:17.960
you won't have time to deal with it.

405
18:19.830 --> 18:21.880
What does this have to do with working?

406
18:21.880 --> 18:22.640
How is it not related?

407
18:22.640 --> 18:24.000
When it snows,

408
18:25.240 --> 18:26.590
you just hole up

409
18:26.590 --> 18:27.920
at your hospital

410
18:28.160 --> 18:29.090
and keep hiding?

411
18:29.160 --> 18:30.560
What if it keeps snowing?

412
18:30.640 --> 18:32.400
Where would it snow nonstop?

413
18:33.790 --> 18:35.310
What about next winter?

414
18:37.880 --> 18:38.720
Then I'll endure it.

415
18:38.720 --> 18:39.550
What if you can't?

416
18:39.550 --> 18:40.810
If I can't, I'll leave.

417
18:41.310 --> 18:42.570
No way you're leaving!

418
18:45.310 --> 18:46.840
I dare you to say that again.

419
18:48.790 --> 18:49.830
Where are you going to go?

420
18:49.830 --> 18:51.310
Fuzhou? Or Bengbu?

421
18:51.310 --> 18:52.160
What about me?

422
18:53.200 --> 18:54.440
I can barely read or write.

423
18:54.440 --> 18:55.480
Don't you know that?

424
18:55.480 --> 18:56.510
You don't care about me at all, do you?

425
18:56.510 --> 18:57.640
Do you only care about yourself,

426
18:57.640 --> 18:58.570
Liu Zhengliang?

427
19:01.000 --> 19:02.440
Do you like me or not?

428
19:24.680 --> 19:26.000
Is it that hard just to say

429
19:26.000 --> 19:27.070
