430
19:31.270 --> 19:32.110
Fine...

431
19:32.150 --> 19:33.480
You don't have to say it.

432
19:48.240 --> 19:48.920
Take a sip.

433
19:51.720 --> 19:54.160
Taking a sip means you like me.

434
20:09.920 --> 20:10.590
Where are you going?

435
20:10.590 --> 20:11.450
Leave me alone.

436
20:15.160 --> 20:16.000
You came alone?

437
20:15.420 --> 20:19.600
[Have beer and barbecue]

438
20:16.000 --> 20:16.590
Yeah!

439
20:16.590 --> 20:17.550
Come on!

440
20:17.640 --> 20:18.970
-Have a seat. -Sit down!

441
20:19.880 --> 20:21.480
-Is it good? -Life is short. Fill it up!

442
20:21.480 --> 20:21.940
Cheers.

443
20:22.240 --> 20:23.770
-Cheers. Come on. -Cheers.

444
20:24.440 --> 20:27.030
Let's follow this outline to answer

445
20:24.620 --> 20:27.180
[Have beer and barbecue]

446
20:27.030 --> 20:27.830
the questions.

447
20:27.830 --> 20:29.160
No irrelevant topics.

448
20:29.590 --> 20:32.000
After Xiaoximen Hospital was closed down,

449
20:29.660 --> 20:31.020
[Public Concerns]

450
20:31.040 --> 20:33.130
[Xiaoximen Hospital was suddenly closed down.]

451
20:32.000 --> 20:34.070
the authorities did arrange for me to go

452
20:33.150 --> 20:35.210
[Residents around there face difficulties accessing medical care.]

453
20:34.070 --> 20:34.790
to another hospital,

454
20:34.790 --> 20:36.200
but I refused.

455
20:36.240 --> 20:37.300
Why did you refuse?

456
20:40.240 --> 20:41.350
Why is it so cold?

457
20:42.200 --> 20:42.720
What?

458
20:42.720 --> 20:43.480
You now have a habit

459
20:43.480 --> 20:44.510
of looking into the distance?

460
20:44.510 --> 20:45.240
Pardon?

461
20:45.270 --> 20:46.200
Didn't you look into the distance?

462
20:46.200 --> 20:46.750
Right?

463
20:47.510 --> 20:49.000
You're so funny.

464
20:49.310 --> 20:51.000
You're having a drink and concerned about everything?

465
20:51.000 --> 20:52.110
What does it have to do with you?

466
20:52.110 --> 20:52.910
Don't butt in.

467
20:52.920 --> 20:54.440
No looking? Then let's just drink!

468
20:54.440 --> 20:56.240
Let's just drink!

469
20:56.240 --> 20:56.510
Come on!

470
20:56.510 --> 20:57.110
Have another drink!

471
20:57.110 --> 20:58.640
Let's drink, huh?

472
20:58.640 --> 20:59.920
Drink all night!

473
20:59.830 --> 21:00.670
[Public Concerns]

474
21:00.000 --> 21:01.160
But it can

475
21:00.690 --> 21:03.090
[Xiaoximen Hospital was suddenly closed down.]

476
21:01.160 --> 21:03.480
give the nearby residents a choice

477
21:03.110 --> 21:05.270
[Residents around there face difficulties accessing medical care.]

478
21:04.270 --> 21:05.870
when they need medical care.

479
21:06.030 --> 21:08.000
You can't leave the common people with no choice

480
21:08.000 --> 21:09.240
