481
21:09.240 --> 21:10.270
Long!

482
21:10.640 --> 21:11.510
Well said!

483
21:11.340 --> 21:14.290
[Xiaoximen Hospital was suddenly closed down.]

484
21:11.510 --> 21:12.970
What does "the best" mean?

485
21:13.070 --> 21:14.590
What fits is the best.

486
21:14.310 --> 21:17.070
[Residents around there face difficulties accessing medical care.]

487
21:15.240 --> 21:16.000
Yeah!

488
21:16.440 --> 21:18.240
Xiaoximen Hospital can't be closed!

489
21:18.240 --> 21:20.840
