492
21:37.350 --> 21:37.960
Where to?

493
21:37.960 --> 21:38.790
Let's go somewhere else.

494
21:38.790 --> 21:39.440
Yeah!

495
21:39.440 --> 21:39.720
Right?

496
21:39.720 --> 21:40.310
Let's go to the KTV.

497
21:40.310 --> 21:41.510
We can sing while drinking.

498
21:41.510 --> 21:42.240
Shall we?

499
21:42.240 --> 21:42.720
Yep!

500
21:42.720 --> 21:43.480
You arrange it!

501
21:43.480 --> 21:44.110
Okay, good.

502
21:44.110 --> 21:44.480
Good?

503
21:44.480 --> 21:45.480
Then you guys go.

504
21:45.480 --> 21:46.680
-Let's go! -Let's go.

505
21:47.240 --> 21:47.960
What do you mean?

506
21:47.960 --> 21:48.820
W-Who's going?

507
21:48.920 --> 21:50.110
Aren't you going to the KTV?

508
21:50.110 --> 21:50.970
What about you?

509
21:51.030 --> 21:52.200
Why would I go?

510
21:52.200 --> 21:52.790
If you're not going,

511
21:52.790 --> 21:54.200
