512
21:54.510 --> 21:55.830
You should join us.

513
21:55.480 --> 22:01.030
[Late Night Snack] [Meet for drinks and fun]

514
21:55.830 --> 21:57.590
You're going to the KTV.

515
21:57.590 --> 21:59.550
It's mainly for you, beautiful.

516
21:59.830 --> 22:01.110
I saw it clearly.

517
22:01.310 --> 22:02.350
You were unhappy

518
22:02.350 --> 22:03.480
