519
22:03.790 --> 22:04.960
What do you mean?

520
22:04.960 --> 22:06.220
You were just unhappy.

521
22:06.270 --> 22:07.400
How about this?

522
22:08.110 --> 22:09.480
Why don't you date me?

523
22:10.160 --> 22:10.790
I definitely

524
22:10.790 --> 22:12.320
