525
22:13.310 --> 22:14.720
I promise you here.

526
22:15.640 --> 22:16.440
Okay?

527
22:16.440 --> 22:18.030
How can you have the nerve to say that?

528
22:18.030 --> 22:19.440
Let go of me right now.

529
22:19.960 --> 22:20.880
If you touch me again,

530
22:20.880 --> 22:21.960
