531
22:21.960 --> 22:23.070
Come on, stop it.

532
22:23.160 --> 22:24.350
What's this fuss?

533
22:24.350 --> 22:26.480
You came here after being dumped.

534
22:26.830 --> 22:29.070
Didn't you come here by yourself?

535
22:29.070 --> 22:29.550
Yeah.

536
22:29.550 --> 22:30.310
Did I pull you over?

537
22:30.310 --> 22:31.590
Where did you see that?

538
22:31.590 --> 22:33.030
Stop talking nonsense here.

539
22:33.030 --> 22:34.160
Hey, I mean, why are you still

540
22:34.160 --> 22:35.510
playing the chaste woman

541
22:35.510 --> 22:36.480
at this point?

542
22:36.880 --> 22:37.790
Sir, check, please.

543
22:37.790 --> 22:38.440
Okay.

544
22:38.440 --> 22:39.270
Right?

545
22:39.480 --> 22:40.000
What?

546
22:40.000 --> 22:41.510
Is my buddy not good enough for you?

547
22:41.510 --> 22:42.640
Am I not good enough?

548
22:42.680 --> 22:44.110
Sorry, he's drunk.

549
22:44.110 --> 22:44.680
No...

550
22:44.680 --> 22:45.750
He's out of his mind due to the alcohol.

551
22:45.750 --> 22:47.350
Never mind. My apologies.

552
22:47.350 --> 22:48.000
Okay?

553
22:48.000 --> 22:50.070
You... I just like the way you are!

554
22:50.790 --> 22:52.510
I'm already falling deeply in love with you.

555
22:52.510 --> 22:53.270
How about this?

556
22:53.270 --> 22:54.680
Well, let's go

557
22:54.680 --> 22:56.340
to the KTV and sing for a while.

558
22:56.960 --> 22:58.030
I'll pay you,

559
22:58.510 --> 22:59.160
okay?

560
22:59.160 --> 23:01.090
Would you dare to listen to me sing?

561
23:01.720 --> 23:02.640
Why wouldn't I?

562
23:02.640 --> 23:04.160
What if I send you to see

563
23:04.160 --> 23:05.550
your second great-uncle, buddy?

564
23:05.550 --> 23:06.070
Listen,

565
23:06.070 --> 23:07.240
sing with me, and you can even

566
23:07.240 --> 23:08.680
send me to see my third great-grandmother!

567
23:08.680 --> 23:10.110
Stop it! Don't talk nonsense!

568
23:10.110 --> 23:11.830
I'm not going. Do you hear me?

569
23:10.250 --> 23:14.110
[Have beer and barbecue]

570
23:11.960 --> 23:13.880
Do I have to carve it on a gravestone for you or what?

571
23:13.880 --> 23:14.680
Listen.

572
23:14.680 --> 23:15.550
Don't point at me.

573
23:15.550 --> 23:16.550
I'm pointing at you!

574
23:16.550 --> 23:18.270
-You must come with me today! -It's useless!

575
23:18.270 --> 23:18.960
If you don't come,

576
23:18.960 --> 23:20.000
