577
23:20.000 --> 23:20.640
Let's get along well.

578
23:20.640 --> 23:21.750
You'll need me in the future,

579
23:21.750 --> 23:22.240
you know?

580
23:22.240 --> 23:23.590
Who are you talking to?

581
23:23.590 --> 23:24.480
I'm talking to you!

582
23:24.480 --> 23:24.880
What?

583
23:24.920 --> 23:26.980
You're not showing me any respect...

584
23:31.710 --> 23:34.170
[Late Night Snack] [Meet for drinks and fun]

585
23:33.510 --> 23:34.510
Are you okay, bro?

586
23:36.350 --> 23:37.000
Hit him!

587
23:37.440 --> 23:38.160
Stop there!

588
23:38.160 --> 23:39.070
Don't run! Stop!

589
23:39.070 --> 23:39.680
Stop there!

590
23:39.680 --> 23:40.810
-Stop there! -Stop!

591
23:42.000 --> 23:42.800
Stop running!

592
23:42.880 --> 23:44.270
Stop! Stop there!

593
23:44.920 --> 23:46.680
Don't run! Do you hear me?

594
23:46.680 --> 23:47.440
Get him!

595
23:47.680 --> 23:48.440
Where is he?

596
23:48.440 --> 23:49.960
-Get him! -Catch him!

597
23:50.640 --> 23:51.500
Still running?

598
23:51.680 --> 23:52.540
Where are they?

599
23:53.480 --> 23:54.720
Hurry. Be careful.

600
23:56.760 --> 24:04.140
[Tsingtao Brewery] [Natural freshness, pure taste]

601
24:01.920 --> 24:03.030
We shook them off.

602
24:05.680 --> 24:07.280
The 4 of them also drank a lot.

603
24:11.240 --> 24:13.240
And their lung capacity isn't good.

604
24:18.000 --> 24:20.510
You actually... actually hit him?

605
24:22.400 --> 24:23.550
Why is it different

606
24:23.550 --> 24:24.550
