607
24:25.640 --> 24:27.030
Why didn't the bottle break?

608
24:27.030 --> 24:28.630
How could it break so easily?

609
24:29.070 --> 24:31.400
You'll know after you hit a few more times.

610
24:38.590 --> 24:40.030
Okay, I'll go find them.

611
24:44.830 --> 24:45.960
Stop it.

612
24:45.960 --> 24:47.160
You really scared me.

613
24:50.200 --> 24:51.510
Come on, put it on now.

614
24:52.270 --> 24:53.600
Keep your stomach warm.

615
24:57.720 --> 25:00.120
And you didn't even leave anything behind.

616
25:03.160 --> 25:04.160
Where's my phone?

617
25:05.110 --> 25:06.030
Here, here on me.

618
25:06.030 --> 25:06.830
I've got it.

619
26:20.200 --> 26:21.130
Sit a bit closer.

620
26:43.720 --> 26:44.510
Ice.

621
26:45.480 --> 26:46.310
What ice?

622
26:46.750 --> 26:47.680
Ridiculous.

623
26:47.720 --> 26:48.510
No,

624
26:48.750 --> 26:49.550
I mean,

625
26:49.880 --> 26:51.750
