626
26:53.510 --> 26:54.440
What do you mean?

627
26:56.310 --> 26:57.070
Let's try

628
26:57.070 --> 26:58.830
the exposure therapy you mentioned again.

629
26:58.830 --> 27:00.110
But this time, no snow.

630
27:00.400 --> 27:01.200
We'll use ice.

631
27:02.960 --> 27:04.920
You mean the ice in the fridge?

632
27:05.960 --> 27:07.160
Not that kind of ice.

633
27:07.550 --> 27:09.680
Um... It has to be a large one.

634
27:09.680 --> 27:10.960
The larger, the better.

635
27:10.960 --> 27:12.480
Preferably the kind you can step on.

636
27:12.480 --> 27:13.720
It's spring.

637
27:14.000 --> 27:15.330
