638
27:15.510 --> 27:17.680
Where can we find such a large piece of ice?

639
27:17.680 --> 27:19.160
Like an ice sports arena?

640
27:19.680 --> 27:21.340
We don't have that in Fucheng.

641
27:24.880 --> 27:27.140
Then let's find a place where there is...

642
27:30.590 --> 27:31.850
I know where to find...

643
27:33.960 --> 27:34.720
ice.

644
27:36.060 --> 27:37.000
[Fantasy City of Aquamarine Star]

645
27:38.480 --> 27:39.310
Here we are!

646
27:39.050 --> 27:44.480
[Fantasy City of Aquamarine Star]

647
27:39.310 --> 27:40.110
This is it.

648
27:40.920 --> 27:42.590
When did this aquarium open?

649
27:42.590 --> 27:43.520
I didn't know it!

650
27:43.680 --> 27:44.680
It says

651
27:44.680 --> 27:45.810
the main attraction

652
27:45.830 --> 27:47.160
of this aquarium

653
27:47.160 --> 27:48.310
is the penguin show.

654
27:48.550 --> 27:49.680
Penguins are the clue!

655
27:49.680 --> 27:50.310
If there are penguins,

656
27:50.310 --> 27:51.960
there must be ice.

657
27:52.750 --> 27:54.720
Uncle Che, you're amazing.

658
27:54.720 --> 27:56.120
Let's keep a low profile.

659
27:56.550 --> 27:57.400
Are you ready?

660
27:58.070 --> 27:58.960
Are you ready?

661
28:00.200 --> 28:00.880
Three,

662
28:01.070 --> 28:01.720
two,

663
28:01.830 --> 28:02.400
one,

664
28:02.720 --> 28:03.510
let's go!

665
28:07.880 --> 28:09.510
Why isn't there even a ticket office?

666
28:09.510 --> 28:10.910
There's no one else here.

667
28:11.000 --> 28:12.030
Yeah.

668
28:12.350 --> 28:14.000
Did we come too early?

669
28:13.700 --> 28:17.250
[Ocean Kingdom] [Paradise of Lovely Animals]

670
28:15.830 --> 28:16.720
It doesn't matter if it's empty,

671
28:16.720 --> 28:17.750
as long as there's ice,

672
28:17.750 --> 28:18.550
right?

673
28:29.440 --> 28:30.400
It's not even cold here.

674
28:30.400 --> 28:31.110
No.

675
28:31.640 --> 28:33.200
It's all melted into water, huh?

676
28:33.200 --> 28:33.960
Yeah,

677
28:33.960 --> 28:35.030
