678
28:35.030 --> 28:35.440
Where are the penguins?

679
28:35.440 --> 28:37.350
These are fake, too.

680
28:41.030 --> 28:41.830
Uncle Che.

681
28:44.590 --> 28:45.920
What are you doing here?

682
28:46.640 --> 28:47.720
Who let you in?

683
28:48.550 --> 28:49.350
Sir,

684
28:49.550 --> 28:50.440
we're looking for penguins.

685
28:50.440 --> 28:51.510
Where are they?

686
28:52.790 --> 28:54.350
They left for their hometown.

687
28:54.350 --> 28:55.350
T-They left?

688
28:55.720 --> 28:56.510
Hometown?

689
28:56.720 --> 28:57.640
The South Pole?

690
28:58.200 --> 28:59.270
How did they leave?

691
28:59.270 --> 29:00.440
By taxi.

692
29:01.110 --> 29:02.000
"How did they leave?"

693
29:02.000 --> 29:03.720
It's been closed for so long,

694
29:03.790 --> 29:05.270
and you just thought of coming

695
29:05.270 --> 29:06.400
to see the penguins?

696
29:06.750 --> 29:07.750
Go... Get out.

697
29:08.550 --> 29:09.550
I just mopped the floor.

698
29:09.550 --> 29:10.440
Get out!

699
29:10.440 --> 29:12.070
-I-I'm sorry. -Sorry for that.

700
29:12.070 --> 29:12.880
We'll leave in a bit.

701
29:12.880 --> 29:14.810
Yeah, we didn't know it was closed.

702
29:15.960 --> 29:17.960
When is Uncle Che's newspaper from?

703
29:18.030 --> 29:19.070
Seriously.

704
29:21.200 --> 29:22.270
What? Where is he?

705
29:23.720 --> 29:24.510
Uncle Che!

706
29:27.220 --> 29:32.100
[Underwater Tunnel]

707
29:27.510 --> 29:28.510
Uncle Che!

708
29:31.270 --> 29:32.720
Why did he go up there?

709
29:37.920 --> 29:38.720
Uncle Che!

710
29:40.000 --> 29:40.920
I promised Mingming

711
29:40.920 --> 29:41.790
I'd take good care of you.

712
29:41.790 --> 29:43.070
Can you not run around?

713
29:43.310 --> 29:44.070
Alright, alright.

714
29:44.070 --> 29:45.200
Keep quiet.

715
29:45.270 --> 29:47.270
It's sick. Can't you see it's sick?

716
29:49.200 --> 29:50.920
It doesn't look too well.

717
29:51.640 --> 29:52.680
It's listless.

718
29:53.240 --> 29:54.510
Dr. Liu, treat it.

719
29:55.750 --> 29:57.030
I'm not a vet.

720
29:57.240 --> 29:58.970
It's the same. You can treat it.

721
30:01.750 --> 30:03.070
Keep quiet, come on.

722
30:04.510 --> 30:05.640
Can't you understand me?

723
30:05.640 --> 30:07.480
I told you to get out of here.

724
30:07.960 --> 30:09.240
We're leaving soon.

725
30:09.240 --> 30:10.000
Sir,

726
30:10.000 --> 30:11.000
is it sick?

727
30:11.000 --> 30:12.200
What's it to you?

728
30:12.200 --> 30:13.720
If it's sick, it needs treatment.

729
30:13.720 --> 30:15.000
I'm even sicker than it is.

730
30:15.000 --> 30:16.400
Are you going to treat me?

731
30:16.640 --> 30:18.240
Mind your own business.

732
30:18.880 --> 30:19.920
It'll be sold in a couple of days.

733
30:19.920 --> 30:21.240
What does it have to do with you?

734
30:21.240 --> 30:21.920
Get down.

735
30:21.920 --> 30:22.880
Leave now.

736
30:23.110 --> 30:23.880
Get down.

737
30:23.880 --> 30:24.480
Get out!

738
30:24.480 --> 30:25.240
Got it, got it.

739
30:25.240 --> 30:26.510
We're leaving right away.

740
30:26.510 --> 30:27.310
Get down here!

741
30:27.310 --> 30:27.960
Good grief,

742
30:27.960 --> 30:29.070
you scared me, sir.

743
30:29.070 --> 30:30.310
Why are you so timid?

744
30:30.480 --> 30:31.880
-Let's go. -Come down.

745
30:32.240 --> 30:34.000
Oh, no, it didn't work.

746
30:36.070 --> 30:38.480
What do you think seals usually eat?

747
30:39.440 --> 30:40.480
Fish, I guess?

748
30:41.510 --> 30:42.910
Frozen fish or live fish?

749
30:43.310 --> 30:44.770
Are they picky about this?

750
30:45.590 --> 30:47.850
Fewer bones would definitely be better.

751
30:50.310 --> 30:51.640
Would a cold storage

752
30:51.640 --> 30:52.840
for frozen fish work?

753
30:53.350 --> 30:54.640
We can pour water in it

754
30:54.640 --> 30:55.900
and freeze it into ice.

755
30:57.640 --> 30:58.590
It's worth a try.

756
30:59.070 --> 31:01.000
Then let's turn to my dad's friend.

757
31:01.030 --> 31:01.920
He's in the cold chain business

758
31:01.920 --> 31:03.850
and definitely has a cold storage.

759
31:03.880 --> 31:04.510
Okay.

760
31:05.110 --> 31:07.170
There shouldn't be any cameras here.

761
31:15.480 --> 31:16.550
We've found

762
31:16.590 --> 31:18.110
this video. Watch it.

763
31:18.510 --> 31:18.960
I've

764
31:18.960 --> 31:20.220
come up with a new plan.

765
31:20.270 --> 31:21.730
Let's use this rubber band

766
31:22.000 --> 31:23.350
instead of

767
31:24.400 --> 31:26.160
that fly swatter.

768
31:28.590 --> 31:30.270
I told you I don't want to cure it.

769
31:30.270 --> 31:31.750
Why are you not giving up?

770
31:31.750 --> 31:32.510
Amy.

771
31:33.270 --> 31:34.000
Give it a try.

772
31:34.070 --> 31:34.720
I beg you.

773
31:34.720 --> 31:35.030
Come on,

774
31:35.030 --> 31:35.590
let me...

775
31:35.590 --> 31:36.270
L-Let me put it on you.

776
31:36.270 --> 31:37.920
Will this work?

777
31:38.310 --> 31:39.160
So,

778
31:39.200 --> 31:40.110
when you see yourself

779
31:40.110 --> 31:41.400
grabbing something,

780
31:42.440 --> 31:44.350
j-just snap it.

781
31:51.270 --> 31:52.350
What's the use of this?

782
31:52.350 --> 31:52.830
Well,

783
31:52.830 --> 31:54.160
it's like this. Like this.

784
31:54.160 --> 31:55.350
Look.

785
31:55.350 --> 31:56.240
I dare you.

786
31:57.460 --> 31:58.540
[Our service includes what others don't do. Our duty covers what everyone does.]

787
31:58.590 --> 31:59.400
No, no...

788
32:00.510 --> 32:01.880
You said it too late.

789
32:02.070 --> 32:03.000
It hurts!

790
32:03.030 --> 32:04.550
Yes, I know it hurts.

791
32:04.700 --> 32:09.810
[Our service includes what others don't do. Our duty covers what everyone does.]

792
32:04.880 --> 32:06.750
It only works if it hurts, right?

793
32:06.920 --> 32:08.310
I just want to...

794
32:08.720 --> 32:09.550
I'm sorry.

795
32:12.750 --> 32:13.480
How did you come up

796
32:13.480 --> 32:14.880
with such an awful idea?

797
32:14.880 --> 32:15.510
No,

798
32:15.880 --> 32:17.680
I don't have the brains for that.

799
32:19.400 --> 32:20.330
I came up with it.

800
32:23.550 --> 32:24.350
Xiaozhu,

801
32:25.000 --> 32:26.440
I... I treat you

802
32:26.440 --> 32:27.480
like my own son.

803
32:27.720 --> 32:28.720
I know.

804
32:29.110 --> 32:31.510
I've always treated you like my own mother.

805
32:31.510 --> 32:32.510
So this time, I...

806
32:32.510 --> 32:33.510
I'm with my dad.

807
32:34.750 --> 32:35.550
Mom.

808
32:36.480 --> 32:37.880
When you were in prison,

809
32:38.880 --> 32:40.750
I felt terrible at the thought

810
32:41.510 --> 32:43.030
of you suffering in there.

811
32:45.110 --> 32:45.920
Mom,

812
32:46.920 --> 32:48.310
we are family.

813
32:49.030 --> 32:50.690
We all hope you can correct it.

814
32:51.000 --> 32:52.460
Our daughter also agrees.

815
32:54.400 --> 32:55.260
How about this?

816
32:56.110 --> 32:57.170
I'll do it with you.

817
32:57.480 --> 32:58.400
Let me join you.

818
32:58.680 --> 32:59.750
You snap, and I'll snap too.

819
32:59.750 --> 33:00.480
I'll snap too, Mom.

820
33:00.480 --> 33:01.270
I'll do 3.

821
33:05.830 --> 33:06.920
Who was that just now?

822
33:05.900 --> 33:08.400
[Our service includes what others don't do. Our duty covers what everyone does.]

823
33:07.000 --> 33:07.680
You.

824
33:07.680 --> 33:08.400
Don't run.

825
33:23.440 --> 33:24.840
Done walking the horses?

826
33:27.090 --> 33:31.130
[Recommended for you]

827
33:28.550 --> 33:29.510
Xiaoximen Hospital

828
33:29.510 --> 33:30.590
is closed down.

829
33:35.440 --> 33:36.240
What?

830
33:38.200 --> 33:40.200
Xiaoximen Hospital is closed down?

831
33:45.830 --> 33:47.630
Why aren't you saying anything?

832
33:49.070 --> 33:50.930
It has nothing to do with us at all.

833
33:52.000 --> 33:53.930
What's the use of saying anything?

834
34:06.680 --> 34:08.800
You've been acting weird since you got here a few days ago.

835
34:08.800 --> 34:10.460
What exactly do you want to do?

836
34:12.150 --> 34:13.210
What do I want to do?

837
34:14.760 --> 34:16.030
To learn from you.

838
34:17.630 --> 34:19.960
Learn how to escape reality.

839
34:21.280 --> 34:22.480
We are not different.

840
34:23.320 --> 34:24.780
You're even worse than me.

841
34:25.320 --> 34:26.920
At least I know what I'm like,

842
34:27.710 --> 34:28.510
unlike you.

843
34:29.510 --> 34:31.510
You can't accept that you're trash.

844
34:37.070 --> 34:37.960
Say that again.

845
34:42.440 --> 34:43.840
I said you're trash.

846
35:25.440 --> 35:26.230
I'm sorry.

847
35:28.280 --> 35:29.080
My apologies.

848
35:49.480 --> 35:51.150
Look at my new hair color.

849
35:51.320 --> 35:52.320
Isn't it stylish?

850
36:16.880 --> 36:17.670
Do you think Long

851
36:17.670 --> 36:19.270
has something up his sleeve?

852
36:19.880 --> 36:20.480
No idea.

853
36:21.630 --> 36:23.510
Not going to work every day

854
36:24.480 --> 36:25.440
is getting to me.

855
36:25.440 --> 36:26.280
I didn't see you

856
36:26.280 --> 36:27.670
busy working before.

857
36:28.230 --> 36:29.320
You slacked off every day.

858
36:29.320 --> 36:31.650
Lying down at work is called slacking off.

859
36:32.430 --> 36:34.710
Lying down while not at work is just lying down.

860
36:34.710 --> 36:35.880
It feels different.

861
36:35.880 --> 36:37.550
You're not lying down. You're on your stomach.

862
36:37.550 --> 36:39.000
Doesn't it feel right?

863
36:43.280 --> 36:44.070
What's wrong?

864
36:44.070 --> 36:44.840
You...

865
36:45.280 --> 36:47.190
You a-are massaging way too hard.

866
36:47.190 --> 36:47.590
Is that so?

867
36:47.590 --> 36:48.400
Rubbing this spot

868
36:48.400 --> 36:49.360
can easily cause problems.

869
36:49.360 --> 36:50.920
You need to be gentler.

870
36:51.510 --> 36:51.960
Okay, okay.

871
36:51.960 --> 36:52.890
I'll go gentler.

872
36:57.880 --> 36:58.760
Hey, pause...

873
36:59.510 --> 37:01.480
When rubbing the large muscle group in the shoulder,

874
37:01.480 --> 37:02.960
y-you need to apply

875
37:02.960 --> 37:04.150
deeper pressure.

876
37:04.150 --> 37:05.550
Okay, I'll go harder.

877
37:09.440 --> 37:10.230
What is it?

878
37:10.400 --> 37:11.400
Time's not up yet.

879
37:13.590 --> 37:14.510
You, honestly...

880
37:14.510 --> 37:15.360
Come on...

881
37:15.360 --> 37:16.000
You lie down.

882
37:16.000 --> 37:16.840
Let me teach you. Come on.

883
37:16.840 --> 37:18.280
Careful not to break his back.

884
37:18.280 --> 37:19.000
Come on...

885
37:19.070 --> 37:19.840
Well...

886
37:19.840 --> 37:21.510
Massage is all about this,

887
37:21.760 --> 37:22.670
like Tai Chi.

888
37:22.670 --> 37:23.280
Look, look.

889
37:23.280 --> 37:24.920
This is the right pressure, huh?

890
37:24.920 --> 37:25.710
Right?

891
37:25.760 --> 37:27.030
-We can tell you're bored. -You have to work

892
37:27.030 --> 37:29.070
this pressure deeper into the muscle.

893
37:29.070 --> 37:29.920
H-How is it?

894
37:30.190 --> 37:31.000
Nice.

895
37:31.000 --> 37:31.440
Right?

896
37:31.440 --> 37:32.640
Check out this force.

897
37:32.670 --> 37:33.760
And then on top, um,

898
37:33.760 --> 37:34.890
use the elbow. Look.

899
37:35.030 --> 37:36.480
Right? Check this out.

900
37:37.150 --> 37:37.960
Tong,

901
37:38.030 --> 37:38.920
if we two go

902
37:38.920 --> 37:40.480
to the Traditional Chinese Massage Department

903
37:40.480 --> 37:41.440
in our hospital,

904
37:41.440 --> 37:42.760
I'd probably be the chief physician,

905
37:42.760 --> 37:43.320
you know?

906
37:43.320 --> 37:45.050
What are you two talking about?

907
37:48.030 --> 37:49.890
President, what brings you here?

908
37:52.320 --> 37:53.070
President, what do you

909
37:53.070 --> 37:54.800
think of my massage technique?

910
37:54.880 --> 37:55.960
Give me an evaluation.

911
37:55.960 --> 37:56.710
Now that the hospital is gone,

912
37:56.710 --> 37:58.150
why still call me President?

913
37:58.150 --> 38:00.030
Well, even if the hospital is gone, you're still the President.

914
38:00.030 --> 38:01.110
I came to this hospital

915
38:01.110 --> 38:02.480
just because of you.

916
38:05.880 --> 38:06.960
Huang, tell me,

917
38:08.630 --> 38:10.400
if Xiaoximen Hospital were still open,

918
38:10.400 --> 38:12.060
what would its future be like?

919
38:12.550 --> 38:13.360
I...

920
38:14.400 --> 38:16.530
I-I haven't thought about the future.

921
38:16.880 --> 38:17.710
I just think

922
38:17.710 --> 38:18.710
Xiaoximen Hospital was

923
38:18.710 --> 38:20.440
doing pretty well the way it was.

924
38:20.440 --> 38:21.190
Well, even though

925
38:21.190 --> 38:22.550
most of its medical facilities

926
38:22.550 --> 38:24.750
were not as good as other big hospitals,

927
38:24.920 --> 38:26.590
if anyone living around there

928
38:26.590 --> 38:27.670
had a headache or a fever,

929
38:27.670 --> 38:28.280
our Xiaoximen

930
38:28.280 --> 38:28.960
would definitely be

931
38:28.960 --> 38:30.070
the place to go.

932
38:30.630 --> 38:32.630
Then why did you slack off every day?

933
38:33.000 --> 38:34.460
You thought I didn't know?

934
38:34.840 --> 38:36.230
I... I...

935
38:36.230 --> 38:37.670
I-I did slack off at the hospital,

936
38:37.670 --> 38:38.230
but I...

937
38:38.230 --> 38:39.150
I offered

938
38:39.150 --> 38:40.840
free medical care after work, you know.

939
38:40.840 --> 38:42.000
Y-You can go ask around

940
38:42.000 --> 38:43.800
on the streets nearby.

941
38:44.150 --> 38:45.810
I have cured numerous ladies.

942
38:45.960 --> 38:47.360
If you could treat people on the streets,

943
38:47.360 --> 38:49.280
why couldn't you treat them at Xiaoximen?

944
38:49.280 --> 38:50.070
Here's the thing.

945
38:50.070 --> 38:52.030
Look at Liu, Zhengliang,

946
38:52.030 --> 38:53.030
and Mingming now.

947
38:53.710 --> 38:54.880
Every one of them

948
38:54.880 --> 38:56.280
treats patients better than I do.

949
38:56.280 --> 38:57.480
They're doing great.

950
38:57.510 --> 38:59.230
I'm just falling behind.

951
39:01.000 --> 39:02.000
Do you think Xiaoximen

952
39:02.000 --> 39:03.930
is just a place to treat illnesses?

953
39:04.960 --> 39:06.890
If it's about treating illnesses,

954
39:07.360 --> 39:10.160
it's indeed nowhere near as good as big hospitals.

955
39:10.230 --> 39:12.030
It's only fair that it's closed.

956
39:23.030 --> 39:24.110
President Long,

957
39:24.630 --> 39:25.920
I-I don't agree

958
39:26.000 --> 39:26.960
with you on that.

959
39:26.960 --> 39:27.710
I... I...

960
39:27.800 --> 39:28.710
In my point of view,

961
39:28.710 --> 39:30.590
Xiaoximen serves a purpose

962
39:31.880 --> 39:33.190
j-just like this...

963
39:33.630 --> 39:35.510
j-just like this big tree here.

964
39:35.670 --> 39:36.360
Like the trees...

965
39:36.360 --> 39:37.550
Like the trees around here

966
39:37.550 --> 39:38.590
in Central Park.

967
39:38.590 --> 39:39.280
Well...

968
39:40.710 --> 39:41.440
They might

969
39:41.440 --> 39:42.440
n-not appear conspicuous,

970
39:42.440 --> 39:43.590
but once you chop them all down

971
39:43.590 --> 39:44.920
in one fell swoop,

972
39:45.360 --> 39:46.550
people won't have a place

973
39:46.550 --> 39:47.800
to rest in the shade anymore.

974
39:47.800 --> 39:49.800
And including the ones having massages

975
39:49.800 --> 39:51.550
or acupuncture, or even the ones dancing over there—

976
39:51.550 --> 39:53.080
everyone will be affected.

977
40:00.030 --> 40:00.880
You're picking up

978
40:00.880 --> 40:02.110
my way of talking now.

979
40:04.190 --> 40:04.880
What's wrong?

980
40:04.880 --> 40:05.190
Hold on.

981
40:05.190 --> 40:06.510
You may turn over. I need to...

982
40:06.510 --> 40:08.320
I need to rub your b-back.

983
40:09.880 --> 40:11.360
I'm not here for a massage.

984
40:15.400 --> 40:17.000
President, are you leaving?

985
40:24.880 --> 40:27.960
Did I... Did I say anything that offended him?

986
40:30.620 --> 40:33.910
[Restricted area; Authorized personnel only]

987
40:57.480 --> 40:58.280
What's wrong?

988
41:03.280 --> 41:04.070
Mingming.

989
41:04.590 --> 41:05.400
Listen.

990
41:05.630 --> 41:06.690
Listen carefully.

991
41:07.800 --> 41:09.060
Did you hear anything?

992
41:09.400 --> 41:10.190
What is it?

993
41:14.510 --> 41:15.570
The sound of a seal!

994
41:16.630 --> 41:17.070
Nope.

995
41:17.760 --> 41:19.560
I went to the aquarium yesterday

996
41:20.150 --> 41:21.440
and saw a seal.

997
41:23.150 --> 41:24.280
It must be that seal.

998
41:24.480 --> 41:25.360
The aquarium you went to

999
41:25.360 --> 41:26.760
is 7 or 8 kilometers away.

1000
41:27.030 --> 41:28.030
If you could hear it from here,

1001
41:28.030 --> 41:29.360
half of Fucheng could hear it, too.

1002
41:29.360 --> 41:30.560
The seal must be using

1003
41:30.670 --> 41:31.590
frequencies beyond

1004
41:31.590 --> 41:32.510
the range of human hearing

1005
41:32.510 --> 41:33.590
to communicate with me

1006
41:33.590 --> 41:34.630
and ask for help.

1007
41:36.800 --> 41:37.510
Dad.

1008
41:38.150 --> 41:38.920
Dad.

1009
41:39.550 --> 41:40.550
You're human, too.

1010
41:40.550 --> 41:41.920
I'm no ordinary human.

1011
41:43.030 --> 41:44.670
I can receive signals.

1012
41:48.840 --> 41:49.630
Dad.

1013
41:50.920 --> 41:53.000
I heard the signals would be stronger

1014
41:53.000 --> 41:54.330
when people are asleep.

1015
42:04.760 --> 42:05.880
Be quiet.

1016
42:04.790 --> 42:08.610
